# The mouse exits of menu (selex, WW2C.BM) that mouse-1939-allied does not play, written by hand.
# With mighty=1 the main menu waits in Mickey (place 3), and these clicks and keys leave it:
#   - line 1188: Paris clicked (its army is shown and ready to move), then a key: the main menu
#     again;
#   - line 1209: a click on the air force (the plane drawn above Paris, at 115, 118): the Planes
#     menu;
#   - line 1266: at Planes, AirBase (by its letter), then Metz clicked on the map: the air base
#     moves to Metz;
#   - line 1218: a click on the Allied navy (in London, at 136, 14): its menu, then a right click
#     (Esc);
#   - line 1362: two clicks on the side's flag beside the main menu (600, 150), which change the
#     side. The first click is two rows above the menu and sets the row to -3; the second, with
#     the row still -3 and x between 591 and 609, gives the game to the Axis side.
# Line 1262, a city clicked for a paratroop drop, is in mouse-paratroop-1941-axis.
# It then quits with keys, which Mickey also takes: Files, Quit, Yes.
#! seed 1939
#! cfg mighty=1

# The pause before the title menu; Start NEW Game; Start Year 1939; the briefing.
prompt
mouse 100 100
press 1
release 1
prompt
mouse 60 263
press 1
release 1
prompt
mouse 165 199
press 1
release 1
prompt
press 2
release 2

# Paris (city 40, at 111, 127), then a key.
prompt
digest
mouse 112 128
press 1
release 1
prompt
digest
key space

# The air force, then AirBase and Metz (city 33, at 176, 145), then a click for the message.
prompt
digest
mouse 115 118
press 1
release 1
prompt
digest
text a
prompt
digest
mouse 176 145
press 1
release 1
prompt
digest
press 1
release 1

# The navy, then a right click.
prompt
digest
mouse 136 14
press 1
release 1
prompt
digest
press 2
release 2

# The side's flag, twice: the Axis side's main menu.
prompt
digest
mouse 600 150
press 1
release 1
prompt
digest
mouse 600 150
press 1
release 1

# Files, Quit, then Yes by its letter, and a key for END's "Press any key to continue".
prompt
digest
text f
prompt
text q
prompt
digest
text y
repeat space
